      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Making happy developers&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Writing software that targets mono remains bumpy in many areas. There have been many strides into improving this situation but the job is far from done.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The objective of this talk is to both show recent advances on this area and gather feedback on how can we make developer happier when developing with mono.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We&amp;#39;ll try to come up with a clever hack to work during the mono hackathon.&lt;/p&gt;      </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="2041">Rodrigo Kumpera</person>
      </persons>
